{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s2_side01_0050.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/s2_side01_0050.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_01",
      "hash64": "6B6AAA96E5DDE546",
      "text": "哇～！\\n這裡就是翠綠鎮！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_02",
      "hash64": "6B6AA996E5DDE393",
      "text": "總覺得空氣聞起來\\n跟帕底亞不一樣呢～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_01",
      "hash64": "8E475FE6A0AFCAA8",
      "text": "呼～呼……頭好暈……\\n終於到村子了……？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_01",
      "hash64": "CA7C0810D70061CA",
      "text": "牡丹妳在巴士上\\n看太多手機了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_02",
      "hash64": "8E4762E6A0AFCFC1",
      "text": "因為我怕……\\n會沒訊號嘛……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "A86DE2BE5C0FF1B2",
      "text": "你們幾個來啦。\\n歡迎歡迎。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_03",
      "hash64": "6B6AA896E5DDE1E0",
      "text": "您好！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "A86DE1BE5C0FEFFF",
      "text": "嗯，你們好。\\n我是村裡設施的管理員。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "A86DE0BE5C0FEE4C",
      "text": "你們的事情我已經\\n從烏栗那裡聽說了。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "A86DDFBE5C0FEC99",
      "text": "除了[VAR 0x0100(0000)]以外，\\n大家都是第一次來北上旅行嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_02",
      "hash64": "CA7C0710D7006017",
      "text": "是的，是這樣沒錯。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_03",
      "hash64": "CA7C0610D7005E64",
      "text": "不不！\\n我們３個人是第一次來啦。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "A86DDEBE5C0FEAE6",
      "text": "是嗎，是嗎。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "A86DDDBE5C0FE933",
      "text": "你們可以住在\\n這棟房子的房間裡喔。\\r\\n被子也已經幫你們曬好了。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_03",
      "hash64": "8E4761E6A0AFCE0E",
      "text": "哇……真周到！[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "A86DDCBE5C0FE780",
      "text": "哈哈哈，那你們幾個\\n就請慢慢享受這裡的生活吧。[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_04",
      "hash64": "6B6AAF96E5DDEDC5",
      "text": "謝謝您！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_04",
      "hash64": "CA7C0510D7005CB1",
      "text": "對了，那個叫烏栗的傢伙……\\n沒有聯絡[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_04",
      "hash64": "8E4764E6A0AFD327",
      "text": "呃！？什麼！？\\n他沒有手機！？\\r\\n竟然有這樣的人！？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_05",
      "hash64": "6B6AAE96E5DDEC12",
      "text": "真是清心寡欲啊～！\\n他會在家裡嗎？\\r\\n不如我們直接去拜訪他？[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_friend_npc",
      "hash64": "A4EB939C873C3800",
      "text": "究竟是誰有資格稱為[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的好朋友，\\n這件事情我得要弄清楚才行。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_botan_npc",
      "hash64": "152B81E1B3A5A5D2",
      "text": "果然這裡訊號不好，\\n手機和我的精神都變得不穩定啦……[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side01_0050_rival_npc",
      "hash64": "91F7116A64E2C80C",
      "text": "烏栗會在家裡嗎！？\\n好想趕快和他打……見面呢～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
